      "description": "Tidal Trust IV - VegaShares Trillions ETF is an exchange traded fund launched and managed by Tidal Investments LLC. The fund is co-managed by Vega Capital Partners LLC. It invests in public equity and fixed income markets of global region. For its equity portion, the fund invests directly and through derivatives in stocks of companies operating across diversified sector. It uses derivatives such as options and swaps to create its portfolio. It invests in growth and value stocks of large-cap companies. For its fixed income portion, the fund invests directly in cash and short-term U.S. Treasury securities. The fund uses fundamental and quantitative analysis to create its portfolio. Tidal Trust IV - VegaShares Trillions ETF was formed on October 1, 2026 and is domiciled in the United States.",
